  "notes": "Files under apache_tier/ are Apache 2.0 (model weights + deposited code-compatible artefacts) or CC-BY 4.0 (data). Files under research_tier/ are CC-BY-NC-ND 4.0 (the trained checkpoint inherits the most-restrictive upstream source-licence tier; per-cohort predictions inherit the same tier). The research-tier extension training CSV is intentionally not deposited; the per-source manifest at research_tier/n3v2_source_manifest.csv documents what would be needed to reconstruct it from upstream distributors."
 },
